or:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;Hey guys!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;I have been wearing these shoes by&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.taller.com.au\/&#039;&gt;www.taller.com.au&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and they are an amazing product! They give me the extra height and confidence I need when I go out with work colleagues, friends, family and my fiancee! These shoes are so comfortable and well made, I am going to wear them for my wedding so I am still a bit taller than my future wife when she is wearing her high heels! If you are a shorter man about to get married, definitely check out these shoes! They will give you the extra height and confidence you need!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908298,"PostDate":1449808786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">Hey guys!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">I have been wearing these shoes by\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.taller.com.au\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.taller.com.au<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">\u00a0and they are an amazing product! They give me the extra height and confidence I need when I go out with work colleagues, friends, family and my fiancee! These shoes are so comfortable and well made, I am going to wear them for my wedding so I am still a bit taller than my future wife when she is wearing her high heels! If you are a shorter man about to get married, definitely check out these shoes! They will give you the extra height and confidence you need!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gtrain40@gmail.com","IpAddress":"58.108.231.49","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449808275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"AlexanderGall","Id":285569,"Name":"AlexanderGall","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79792","Title":"Taller Shoes Australia - Men","LastPostDate":1449808786},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
