b-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-08446600-1451700813.jpg\" title=\"invite.JPG - Size: 122.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-282697-0-08446600-1451700813.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"invite.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I used Vanessa's Wedding Passports and she had a template specific to my resort (Dreams Los Cabos).<\/div>\n<div>I used a local graphic artist to help with the little details and with the printing.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rhomes.jones@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.21.125.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428717291,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282697.jpg?_r=1436371862","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dandi76","Id":282697,"Name":"dandi76","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79825","Title":"Passport Wedding Invitations","LastPostDate":1451700917},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
