8\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">The old <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\">NOW<\/span><\/a><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/57821\/the-now-riviera-cancun' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color: #008080\"> Jade Thread<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"> is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(24,24,24);font-size: 10pt\">* edited to add attachment of NOW Jade Resort Pictures<\/span><\/p