an&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: blue\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Boutonnier Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762686\/width\/600\/height\/520\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Premium Boutonniere $45&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: blue\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Premium Boutonnier Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762688\/width\/600\/height\/522\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Tropical Dinner Centerpieces $65&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Eternity Centerpiece Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762700\/width\/600\/height\/509\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Luxury Dinner Centerpieces $85&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Divine Centerpiece Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762702\/width\/600\/height\/514\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Premium Dinner Centerpieces $230&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Now Jade Premium Centerpiece Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762704\/width\/600\/height\/419\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Ceremony Centerpiece $50&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Columns and Arrangements (2) $180&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Canopy $350&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Flower Wedding Arch $450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Single Flower $12&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Bag with Petals $15&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;Basket with Petals $35&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"NOW Jade Additional Flower Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762707\/width\/600\/height\/640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;Optional Outside&amp;nbsp;Florists:&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;$350 vendor fee &lt;strong&gt;IF&lt;\/strong&gt; the florist comes onto the property.&amp;nbsp; You can have someone meet them at the gate for no cost.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vanessa Jaimes&lt;\/strong&gt; (www.vanessajaimes.com)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span face=\"\"&gt;Juliana - Cancun Florist&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span face=\"\"&gt;(998) 884 11 04, 887 17 00&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: verdana\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: blue\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Bridesmaid Flowers.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762718\/width\/295\/height\/301\" \/&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762720\/width\/333\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762722\/width\/335\/height\/480\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Maya Floral&lt;\/strong&gt; - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #181818\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Centerpieces with local flowers start at $65.00 usd. The flowers we consider as local flowers because they are very easy to get in Mexico are: Roses, Alstroemerias, Snapdragon, Lisianthus, Asian Lilies, Mums, Gerbera daisy, Chrysantemun and some others. We do not have centerpieces (unless they are cocktail centerpieces) under this price, our average priced centerpieces are $75.00 \/ $80.00 usd, centerpieces that include fine flowers like Orchids, Tulips, etc, start at $85.00 usd&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595160,"PostDate":1331773797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n